{"id":"temporada","lemma":"temporada","pos":"noun","rank":944,"glosses":["season (part of a year when something particular happens)","season, series (group of episodes of a television broadcast)","period, span of time"],"ipa":"/tẽ.poˈɾa.dɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"temporadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Ed_Guimaraes-temporada.wav","examples":[{"text":"A temporada de caça acabou.","en":"Hunting season is over.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"hunting"},{"g":"to finish","l":"acabar"}]},{"text":"Quando começa a temporada de pesca?","en":"When does fishing season start?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to start","l":"começar"},{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"fishing"}]},{"text":"Estamos na temporada dos cogumelos.","en":"Mushrooms are in season now.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in the"},null,null,{"g":"mushroom","l":"cogumelo"}]},{"text":"Qual é o seu episódio favorito da segunda temporada?","en":"What's your favorite episode from season two?","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"episode"},{"g":"favourite"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"second","l":"segundo"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"no way"]]},{"text":"Espero que você aproveite esta temporada de férias.","en":"I hope that you enjoy this holiday season.","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"esperar"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to take, appropriate","l":"aproveitar"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"vacation"}]}]}